  "expectedDraftMasterHash": "sha256:ce65a335e6c39333d03c42bddf8d170735758434a64412c0cda264de23b2905a",
  "visualBrief": "Light-blue flat-band suspension bridge with two massive granite arched gateways, open upper suspension-band chambers, vertical hangers, lower deck trusses, twin tram tracks and separate pedestrian rails.",
  "nativeAxes": "+X northeast toward plac Grunwaldzki; -X southwest toward the old-city bank. +Z southeast; +Y up. Road and tram alignment retain the signed mild cross-deck drift.",
