    {
      "url": "https://podroze.gazeta.pl/podroze/7,114158,32093590,chca-przywrocic-niemiecki-napis-na-wroclawskim-moscie-w-sieci.html",
      "observed": "Actually inspected road-front picture: segmental/elliptical large portal arch, panelled spandrel/frieze, twin upper band chambers, exposed rivet rows on broad backstay bands, twin tram tracks and overhead contact wires. Existing source image supplies geometry observations; no proposed inscription added."
